    "B": "The intended correspondent, sharing secret key KB with AS, and its identity B named in message 1.1 and returned in message 1.2 (§2, §3, §4).",
    "CK": "The conversation key that AS generates and sends to A in message 1.2, and A forwards to B in message 1.3 (§3, §4)."
  },
